# Overview

This project is a production-style ETL pipeline that extracts stock market data from the Alpha Vantage API, processes it through a Medallion Architecture (Bronze → Silver → Gold) using Apache Spark, and loads analytics-ready data into PostgreSQL.

The pipeline is fully containerized using Docker and supports incremental loading to avoid reprocessing previously loaded records.

### Tracked Symbols

```text
IBM
AAPL
MSFT
TSCO.LON
```

