# Step-by-Step Pipeline Execution

## Step 1 — Start Containers

```bash
docker compose up -d --build
```

Creates:

* PostgreSQL Container
* PySpark Container
* Docker Network
* Persistent Database Volume

---

## Step 2 — PostgreSQL Initialization

```text
init.sql
      │
      ▼
CREATE TABLE stock_daily
```

Automatically executed during the first database startup.

---

## Step 3 — Execute ETL Pipeline

```bash
docker compose exec pyspark_etl python main.py
```

Execution order:

```text
main.py
│
├── extract_api.py
├── transformation_data.py
└── load_postgres.py
```

---

## Step 4 — Load Configuration

All settings are loaded from:

```text
config/config.json
```

Contains:

* API settings
* Database credentials
* Spark settings
* File paths

---

## Step 5 — Extract Data

Requests are sent to Alpha Vantage:

```text
IBM
AAPL
MSFT
TSCO.LON
```

Data is saved to:

```text
data/raw/stock_market.json
```

---

## Step 6 — Bronze Layer

Converts nested JSON into structured Spark DataFrames.

```text
Nested JSON
      │
      ▼
Flatten JSON
      │
      ▼
Spark DataFrame
```

---

## Step 7 — Silver Layer

Performs data quality checks:

* Date conversion
* Null validation
* Duplicate validation

```text
(symbol, date)
```

must remain unique.

---

## Step 8 — Gold Layer

Creates analytics-ready metrics.

### Derived Columns

| Column           | Formula                   |
| ---------------- | ------------------------- |
| daily_range      | high - low                |
| daily_return_pct | ((close-open)/open) × 100 |
| candle           | Bullish / Bearish         |

---

## Step 9 — Incremental Deduplication

```text
Incoming Data
       │
       ▼
Left Anti Join
       │
       ▼
New Rows Only
```

Already-loaded records are removed before insertion.

---

## Step 10 — Load Into PostgreSQL

```text
Spark DataFrame
        │
        ▼
JDBC
        │
        ▼
PostgreSQL
```

Append-only loading strategy.

---

## Step 11 — Update Checkpoint

```json
{
  "last_loaded_date": "2026-05-18"
}
```

Saved after successful loads.

---

## Step 12 — Logging

Log file:

```text
logs/etl_pipeline.log
```

Records:

```text
Extraction
Transformation
Loading
Errors
Checkpoint Updates
```

