# Incremental Load Strategy

Checkpoint Example:

```json
{
  "last_loaded_date": "2026-05-18"
}
```

Process:

```text
Checkpoint
      │
      ▼
Fetch Window
      │
      ▼
Extract Data
      │
      ▼
Left Anti Join
      │
      ▼
Load New Records
      │
      ▼
Save Checkpoint
```

### Deduplication Layers

| Layer      | Method         |
| ---------- | -------------- |
| Extraction | Date Filtering |
| Spark      | Left Anti Join |
| PostgreSQL | Primary Key    |

